{"3172820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abyss Stares at You", "steam_appid": 3172820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a sci-fi horror where the ocean's deepest trench becomes your prison, and the abyss watches your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunge into the Unknown:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a marine biologist who took on a prestigious research project in the Mariana Trench. Your task: spend 40 days alone on an underwater base perched on a ledge of the trench, collecting and analyzing unique life forms that inhabit this unexplored frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something lurks in the depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication with the surface grows unstable, your supervisor's messages turn into cryptic warnings, and unexplained phenomena multiply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Secrets of the Deep:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting underwater base: Navigate claustrophobic corridors, investigate abandoned labs, and uncover the dark secrets of past expeditions. What happened here?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and analyze unique specimens: Utilize advanced scientific tools to study the fascinating—and sometimes terrifying—life forms that call the abyss home. Will your discoveries hold the key to survival?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles and overcome perilous obstacles: Can you escape this underwater trap and expose the expedition organizers who want you silenced? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly immersive sci-fi horror: The crushing pressure, the isolating darkness, the paranoia—the abyss will test your sanity. Will you succumb to its gaze, or will you fight to survive?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a sci-fi horror where the ocean's deepest trench becomes your prison, and the abyss watches your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plunge into the Unknown:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a marine biologist who took on a prestigious research project in the Mariana Trench. Your task: spend 40 days alone on an underwater base perched on a ledge of the trench, collecting and analyzing unique life forms that inhabit this unexplored frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But something lurks in the depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication with the surface grows unstable, your supervisor's messages turn into cryptic warnings, and unexplained phenomena multiply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Secrets of the Deep:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting underwater base: Navigate claustrophobic corridors, investigate abandoned labs, and uncover the dark secrets of past expeditions. What happened here?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and analyze unique specimens: Utilize advanced scientific tools to study the fascinating—and sometimes terrifying—life forms that call the abyss home. Will your discoveries hold the key to survival?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles and overcome perilous obstacles: Can you escape this underwater trap and expose the expedition organizers who want you silenced? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a truly immersive sci-fi horror: The crushing pressure, the isolating darkness, the paranoia—the abyss will test your sanity. Will you succumb to its gaze, or will you fight to survive?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Trapped in an underwater base on a ledge of the Mariana Trench. Solve the mystery, survive the abyss, and escape before it claims you too. A sci-fi horror where the depths hold more than just darkness.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172820/25e1a3447c53817d0ba521311d69555f6f2f2191/header.jpg?t=1781561953", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172820/861705832306d3a59ac10672752a131f613b8fab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781561953", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172820/861705832306d3a59ac10672752a131f613b8fab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781561953", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro